# core=3.0: AIExtractionActivity, AIDiscardedExtraction, SocialHistoryConsent dataclasses added
# core=3.1-3.3: AdvisoryApplicationActivity, AIGenerationActivity, GenerationTrigger, ProxyAgent, AIAsserted provenance leaf added
# clinical=1.8: ClinicalSocialHistoryRecord dataclass added (EHR-extracted, 42 CFR Part 2)
